1
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:09,280
I don't know.

2
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:42,760
Angie?

3
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:44,780
Tim, what...

4
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:47,000
I can't believe it. You're here?

5
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,700
I heard we bought a house.

6
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:53,180
Yeah, it was for my mother, but...

7
00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:55,820
Hi.

8
00:01:02,980 --> 00:01:03,500
Hi.

9
00:01:11,020 --> 00:01:15,620
Der Mietmarkt ist hier eigentlich ganz
gut, zumindest während der Schießsaison.

10
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:37,920
Look at this.

11
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:41,680
Who is Axel Nielsen?

12
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:44,060
What? What?

13
00:01:45,070 --> 00:01:46,200
You've already understood me.

14
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:52,780
Nielsen was my family name.

15
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:56,480
It's the Norwegian counterpart to Schmidt.

16
00:01:56,700 --> 00:01:58,180
Or... Chang.

17
00:01:59,070 --> 00:01:59,720
So I changed it.

18
00:02:01,490 --> 00:02:02,520
You never mentioned that.

19
00:02:08,940 --> 00:02:09,800
Hi, Lars.

20
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:12,040
I'll be late.

21
00:02:12,540 --> 00:02:14,120
I'll be back as soon as I can, okay?

22
00:02:19,220 --> 00:02:19,780
Okay.

23
00:02:23,920 --> 00:02:25,960
I wasn't honest with you.

24
00:02:27,720 --> 00:02:32,580
The case I was sent here
for is more complicated

25
00:02:32,580 --> 00:02:33,520
than I thought.

26
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:37,960
So that's what it's all about.

27
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:42,000
You told me you've been staying
here longer because of your mother.

28
00:02:43,100 --> 00:02:44,860
Yeah, yeah, I know, but...

29
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:46,500
Oh my God.

30
00:02:47,300 --> 00:02:48,100
That's unbelievable.

31
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:50,320
You're such an asshole.

32
00:02:52,420 --> 00:02:53,420
I'm looking for a hotel.

33
00:03:20,620 --> 00:03:23,420
I'll be right back.

34
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:43,340
Freund freigesprochen.
